t elementor-element-57a72aa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"57a72aa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab9c0df elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ab9c0df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Desmaterializa\u00e7\u00e3o de Documentos<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-697cd12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"697cd12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A implementa\u00e7\u00e3o do eCMR permite efetuar a desmaterializa\u00e7\u00e3o dos processos associados ao transporte de carga terrestre, incluindo a comunica\u00e7\u00e3o das guias de transporte internacionais.<\/p><p>O CMR tradicional (papel) \u00e9 substitu\u00eddo pelo eCMR (digital) o que se traduz na partilha da informa\u00e7\u00e3o por todos os intervenientes, simplificando os procedimentos log\u00edsticos e promovendo maior efici\u00eancia e redu\u00e7\u00e3o de custos operacionais.<\/p><p>Al\u00e9m disso, contribui para a sustentabilidade ambiental ao diminuir o uso de papel e agiliza o acesso \u00e0 informa\u00e7\u00e3o em tempo real, melhorando a transpar\u00eancia e a rastreabilidade ao longo de toda a cadeia de transporte.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f090d26 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f090d26\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38bd934 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"38bd934\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"461\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/2-41-768x461.png\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-14537\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/2-41-768x461.png 768w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/2-41-300x180.png 300w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-c